// Whether a call lowered for its value has to be cut after. It does when its
// callee is on mxnames, or when it goes through a pointer whose type is known.
// A name no declaration gives a type (a runtime builtin the program never
// declared) is not cut: its result type would be guessed as int, and the
// temporary that carries the value across the cut would narrow it.
mx_hoist(int id) {
  int hit = call_listed(id, (import mxnames));
  if(hit == 0) {
    hit = hoist_ind(id);
  }
} return int hit;
